# The compiled Fit theme under dist/ is committed ON PURPOSE.
#
# It's generated by the Astryx CLI (`pnpm --filter @fit/astryx-theme theme:build`),
# which hard-requires Node >=22.13 — a version neither CI nor the Vercel/deploy
# pipelines run. Rather than run the CLI in the build (and force a repo-wide Node
# bump), we ship its output: apps import the prebuilt `dist/theme.css` + `dist/fit.js`
# directly. `@astryxdesign/core` itself has no such Node floor, so the apps build
# and run on Node 20 as before.
#
# Re-include dist/ past the repo-root `.gitignore` `dist/` rule.
!/dist/
!/dist/**
